<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Einstein/Noah initiated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Einstein/Noah initiated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said analyst Peter Oakes initiated coverage of Einstein/Noah Bagel Corp with a near-term and long-term accumulate rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 29-1/8 Friday.</p>
</text>
